      Data: 83|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Seconds to wait between dealing each card. Purely the pace of the animation
        - nothing per-card goes on the wire any more, so this is free to lower. Values
        below one frame just deal a card per frame. 0.05 gives a brisk Klondike deal
        in about 1.5s and a 54-card Spider one in under 3.
    - Name: 
