    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Generic interact on the reshuffle trigger. Shown only while the local
        player's running game can still be restarted for free - no card has moved
        since the deal, in a normal game or a double-or-nothing one - and hidden
        the rest of the time. Wire its GameInteract callback to _OnReshuffle.
