    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Generic interact on the undo trigger. Hidden until the local player's
        first move (when reshuffling is no longer possible); once visible it stays
        for the rest of the game, with the icon swapping between filled and outline
        to show whether an undo is currently possible. Wire its GameInteract callback
        to _OnUndoPressed.
